  "code": "BD",
  "name": "Bangladesh"
 },
 "_source": "Spot coordinates from Open-Meteo/OpenStreetMap, each checked against its district. Three were wrong and use verified anchors instead — see _anchored. Dhaka division spots added 2026-10-30 from OpenStreetMap, each checked to fall in Dhaka division and its district (Hajiganj and Sonakanda forts sit on the Narayanganj border; OSM's own address confirms Narayanganj). Chattogram division spots added 2026-10-30 the same way: OpenStreetMap, each checked against OSM's own district and division (Muhuri Project's sluice gate sits on the Feni-Chattogram border; Nijhum Dwip is Hatiya, Noakhali, though its nearest district centre is in Barishal division). Sylhet, Khulna, Barishal, Rajshahi, Rangpur and Mymensingh spots added 2026-10-30 the same way. A few sit nearer another division's district centre than their own (Tanguar Haor, the Bagerhat mosques, Shilaidaha, Hardinge Bridge); their district and division are as OSM gives them.",
 "_default": "The place the home page starts on. Exactly one, enforced by tests.",
 "_anchored": {
  "Nilgiri": "geocoders returned the Nilgiri Hills in India, 1588km away; anchored to Chimbuk peak on the range it sits on",
  "Bholaganj Sada Pathor": "unmapped, and 'Bholaganj' matches a different place 30km south; anchored to Companiganj upazila",
  "Bichanakandi": "unmapped; anchored to Companiganj upazila, which contains it",
  "Mithamain Haor": "the haor spans the upazila; anchored to Mithamain upazila's centre",
  "Tungipara": "anchored to Tungipara upazila's centre",
  "Atia Mosque": "not mapped by name; anchored to Atia village, Delduar, which it stands in",
  "Dhanbari Nawab Palace": "not mapped by name; anchored to Dhanbari town, Tangail, which it stands in",
  "Guliakhali Beach": "the beach is not mapped by name; anchored to Guliakhali village beside it",
  "Khoiyachora Waterfall": "not mapped; anchored to Khaiyachhara village, Mirsharai, the trailhead",
  "Shah Porir Dwip": "not mapped by name; anchored to Sabrang, Teknaf, on the same southern tip",
  "Maheshkhali Island": "anchored to Adinath Temple, the island's main sight",
  "Inani Beach": "anchored to the mapped beach at Inani (Sea Pearl), Ukhia",
  "Shuvolong Waterfall": "anchored to Shuvolong hill, Barkal, beside the falls",
  "Chandpur Boro Station": "anchored to Chandpur launch terminal at Boro Station, by the river confluence",
  "Niladri Lake": "not mapped by name; anchored to Tekerghat, Tahirpur, where the lake is",
  "Bhimruli Floating Market": "anchored to the Kirtipasha-Bhimruli road at Bhimruli, Jhalokati",
  "Jamuna Bridge": "anchored to Saidabad station at the bridge's west end, Sirajganj",
  "Rabindra Kachharibari": "not mapped by name; anchored to Shahzadpur town, Sirajganj, which it stands in",
  "Choto Sona Mosque": "not mapped by name; anchored to Sonamasjid, Shibganj, the village named after it",
  "Uttara Ganabhaban": "anchored to the bird sanctuary in the palace grounds, Dighapatia",
  "Tajhat Palace": "not mapped by name; anchored to Tajhat, Rangpur",
  "Tin Bigha Corridor": "anchored to Dahagram union, Patgram, which the corridor serves",
  "Balia Mosque": "not mapped by name; anchored to Bhulli bazar, Thakurgaon, beside it",
  "Shashi Lodge": "mapped as the Government Teachers' Training College (Women) it now houses",
  "Muktagachha Zamindar Bari": "anchored to Muktagachha town, which it stands in",
  "Birishiri": "anchored to Birishiri village, Durgapur"
 },
